{"seq":3,"slug":"join-algorithms","title":"连接算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/access-methods/join-algorithms","wordCount":1476,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"连接算法\">连接算法</h1><p>把两张表按某个条件拼到一起，是关系型数据库最常见也最昂贵的操作。一条查询慢，十有八九慢在连接上。数据库有三种主力连接算法——嵌套循环、哈希连接、排序合并——它们的代价随表的大小、是否有序、是否有索引差出几个数量级。优化器为每个连接挑算法、为多表连接挑顺序，是 <a href=\"../optimization/cost-based-optimizer\">基于代价的优化器</a> 最核心的工作。这一篇专讲这三种算法本身：它们怎么工作、各自的代价、各自的甜区。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三种算法对应三种「配对」思路：逐个试（嵌套循环）、建哈希表快速查（哈希连接）、各自排好序再并排走（排序合并）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[连接 R ⋈ S] --&gt; B{哪种算法?}&#10;    B --&gt; C[嵌套循环&lt;br/&gt;对 R 每行扫 S]&#10;    B --&gt; D[哈希连接&lt;br/&gt;用小表建哈希表&lt;br/&gt;大表逐行探测]&#10;    B --&gt; E[排序合并&lt;br/&gt;两表各自排序&lt;br/&gt;归并扫描]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[小表 或 内表有索引]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[等值连接 + 内存够]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[数据已有序 或 需要有序输出]\">flowchart TD\n    A[连接 R ⋈ S] --&gt; B{哪种算法?}\n    B --&gt; C[嵌套循环&lt;br/&gt;对 R 每行扫 S]\n    B --&gt; D[哈希连接&lt;br/&gt;用小表建哈希表&lt;br/&gt;大表逐行探测]\n    B --&gt; E[排序合并&lt;br/&gt;两表各自排序&lt;br/&gt;归并扫描]\n    C --&gt; C1[小表 或 内表有索引]\n    D --&gt; D1[等值连接 + 内存够]\n    E --&gt; E1[数据已有序 或 需要有序输出]</pre><p>下表对比三者的代价与适用场景，是优化器选择的依据。</p>\n<p>| 算法     | 时间复杂度 | 是否需等值条件 | 内存需求 | 甜区 |\n| -------- | ---------- | -------------- | -------- | ---- | --- | ---------- | ------------ | ----------------- | --- | ------------ | ---------- | ------------------- |\n| 嵌套循环 | <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(        | R              | \\times   | S    | )</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>  | 否         | 极低         | 小表 / 内表有索引 |\n| 哈希连接 | <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(        | R              | +        | S    | )</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>  | 是（等值） | 高（哈希表） | 大表等值连接      |\n| 排序合并 | <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(        | R              | \\log     | R    | +   | S          | \\log         | S                 | )</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>  | 否（含范围） | 中（排序） | 已排序 / 需有序输出 |</p>\n<h2 id=\"嵌套循环连接\">嵌套循环连接</h2><p>嵌套循环（Nested Loop Join）是最朴素的算法：外表每取一行，就把内表整个扫一遍找匹配。朴素实现的代价是两表大小的乘积，对两张百万行的表就是万亿次比较，完全不可接受。</p>\n<p>但它有两个能起死回生的变体。其一，当外表很小（比如过滤后只剩几十行）时，乘积本身就不大，简单直接反而最快。其二，也是更重要的，当内表在连接列上有索引时，内层循环不必全扫，而是用索引精准定位——这叫索引嵌套循环（Index Nested Loop），代价降为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>outer</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>probe</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>idx-lookup</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\approx |R_{\\text{outer}}| \\times (c_{\\text{probe}} + c_{\\text{idx-lookup}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">outer</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">probe</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">idx-lookup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>外表每行只付一次索引查找的代价（见 <a href=\"scan-methods\">扫描与访问路径</a> 里的索引扫描）。这使索引嵌套循环成为 OLTP 点查类连接（外表几行、内表有主键索引）的首选。嵌套循环还是唯一能处理非等值连接（如 <code>R.a &lt; S.b</code>）和复杂条件的算法——哈希连接做不到。</p>\n<h2 id=\"哈希连接\">哈希连接</h2><p>哈希连接（Hash Join）是大表等值连接的主力。它分两阶段：构建阶段（build）用较小的那张表（构建表）在连接列上建一个内存哈希表；探测阶段（probe）扫描较大的表，对每行用连接列算哈希、去哈希表里查匹配。</p>\n<p>它的代价近似两表大小之和——每张表只读一遍，是三种算法里渐进复杂度最优的，前提是等值连接且哈希表放得进内存。一旦构建表大到内存装不下，就要用 Grace Hash Join 的分区策略：先按哈希把两表都切成多个分区落盘，再逐对分区在内存里连接。落盘带来额外 I/O，性能明显下降——而是否会落盘，取决于优化器对构建表大小的基数估计准不准。估小了，运行时哈希表溢出落盘，这是生产环境哈希连接突然变慢的常见原因，根子在 <a href=\"../foundations/cost-model\">代价模型与基数估计</a> 讲的估计误差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排序合并连接\">排序合并连接</h2><p>排序合并连接（Sort-Merge Join）先把两张表都按连接列排序，然后像拉链一样并排扫描：两个指针各指一表，比较当前两行的连接值，小的那边前进，相等则输出匹配。排序是它的主要成本，但一旦排好，归并只需各扫一遍。</p>\n<p>它的独特价值在两种情况。其一，如果数据本来就有序——比如来自一个走了索引的有序扫描，或来自上一个排序合并连接的输出——排序成本就省了，它瞬间变得极有竞争力。其二，连接结果天然有序，若查询后面还要 <code>ORDER BY</code> 或 <code>GROUP BY</code> 同样的列，这个有序性可以直接复用，省掉后续排序。此外它能处理范围连接条件，比哈希连接适用面广。优化器在权衡时会把「输出是否有序」当作一种有价值的物理属性（interesting order）纳入考量，这是 System R 优化器的经典思想，详见 <a href=\"../optimization/cost-based-optimizer\">基于代价的优化器</a>。下面这段 <code>EXPLAIN</code> 展示了优化器为同一连接选了哈希连接：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"EXPLAIN SELECT * FROM users u JOIN orders o ON u.id = o.uid;&#10;-- Hash Join  (cost=... rows=...)&#10;--   Hash Cond: (o.uid = u.id)&#10;--   -&gt;  Seq Scan on orders o&#10;--   -&gt;  Hash&#10;--         -&gt;  Seq Scan on users u   -- users 作为较小的构建表\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">EXPLAIN </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users u </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">uid</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- Hash Join  (cost=... rows=...)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--   Hash Cond: (o.uid = u.id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--   ->  Seq Scan on orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--   ->  Hash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">--         ->  Seq Scan on users u   -- users 作为较小的构建表</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"连接顺序-算法之上的更大问题\">连接顺序：算法之上的更大问题</h2><p>选对单个连接的算法只是局部最优。当查询连接三张、五张、十张表时，连接的顺序——先连哪两张、中间结果有多大——对总代价的影响往往比单个算法选择更大。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 张表的连接顺序数量随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 阶乘式爆炸，穷举不可行。如何在这个巨大空间里高效搜索，是优化器的核心难题，由动态规划、启发式或遗传算法解决，完整讨论见 <a href=\"../optimization/cost-based-optimizer\">基于代价的优化器</a>。而搜索的每一步都要估中间结果大小，又把我们带回 <a href=\"../optimization/statistics-histograms\">统计信息与直方图</a> 的准确性问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三种主力连接算法对应三种配对思路：逐个试、建哈希表、排序后归并。</li>\n<li>嵌套循环朴素时是乘积代价，但外表小或内表有索引（索引嵌套循环）时极快，且唯一能处理非等值连接。</li>\n<li>哈希连接是大表等值连接首选，代价约为两表之和，但构建表内存放不下会落盘变慢，根因是基数估计误差。</li>\n<li>排序合并的甜区是数据已有序或需要有序输出，能复用物理有序性并处理范围连接。</li>\n<li>单连接算法之上还有连接顺序问题，其搜索空间阶乘爆炸，是优化器的核心难题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"连接算法","id":"连接算法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌套循环连接","id":"嵌套循环连接"},{"level":2,"text":"哈希连接","id":"哈希连接"},{"level":2,"text":"排序合并连接","id":"排序合并连接"},{"level":2,"text":"连接顺序：算法之上的更大问题","id":"连接顺序-算法之上的更大问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"扫描与访问路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/access-methods/scan-methods"},"next":{"title":"基于规则的查询重写","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/query-optimization-execution/optimization/rule-based-rewrite"}}